<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76600" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδίσκ-η</span></b> , ἡ, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖς </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ</span>),
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>young girl, maiden</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.3.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anaxil.
				22.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				102
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. νέα</span>, of a wife,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cic.</u>
				41
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>young female slave, bondmaid</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				1.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13.67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				142
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Gal.</u>
				4.22
			</span></i>: generally, <i>maidservant, Ev. Marc.</i><i><span class="en">
				14.66
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς παῖδας καὶ τὰς π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					12.45
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>prostitute</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				6.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat. Ma.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ δημόσιαι π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					10.437e
				</span></i>
			.</div>
